OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 28 SEP
OL,4,CMISCELLANEOUS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1989FThe current duopoly of seven-day
OL,7,Fradio and television listings held by
OL,8,FRadio Times and TV Times is to end. At
OL,9,Fpresent, publication of advance
OL,10,Flistings other than in the two
OL,11,Fmagazines is severely restricted.
OL,12,
OL,13,FHome Secretary Douglas Hurd has
OL,14,Fconfirmed that new broadcasting laws
OL,15,Fwill force broadcasters to licence the
OL,16,Fpublication of their listings.
OL,17,
OL,18,FBBC Enterprises, who publish the Radio
OL,19,FTimes, said the company was not afraid
OL,20,Fof fair competition. The National
OL,21,FConsumer Council welcomed the news.
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
